  "about": "Expected read results, by account type. Shared by session C's Supabase tests (db/test/supabase-checks.sql) and session G's handler tests. Each cell maps an outcome (an HTTP status, or the word given in 'about') to the release states that give it; every state appears exactly once per cell. 'own' means the caller owns the release (only an artist can); 'other' means another artist's release. A suspended account's claim is end_user, so it reads as end_user.",
